st the data could be re-analysed, this would cause a number of changes to the list of lipid species reported, extending beyond the scope of an Article Correction. We therefore retract this article to prevent any further confusion that our mass spectrometric data may have caused.</p><p id="Par4">All authors agree with this retraction.</p></body><back><fn-group><fn><p>This article has been retracted. Please see the retraction notice for more detail: 10.1038/s41598-022-06491-2.</p></fn></fn-group></back></article></pmc-articleset>